<p>A card serves as an entry point to more detailed information. Cards can contain rich content such as photos, text, links, lists, and tables.</p>
<p>Cards should be used <strong>on non-primary backgrounds</strong> (such as <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">background-secondary</span></span></code></span> or other colored backgrounds) to stand out from the page content.</p>
